        "Content": "Quality 4-Bed Residence within walking distance of Ballymore Eustace village.\n2008 building with 'B' energy rating.\nWell proportioned accommodation throughout with open-plan Living / Kitchen area.\nOption for home base business if desired - ideally suited to Consultancy / Wellness services.\nParticularly private site, fully enclosed and child / pet friendly.\nFootpath walking to Ballymore Eustace village with local primary school and a range of clubs and services.\nDaily public transport links to Naas Town and Blessington."
      },
